Package: libeu0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: C utility library and eubus tools
 Shared library for lists, strings, variants, objects, events, logging,
 sockets, and a small configuration-file parser.
 .
 This package also installs eubd, eubctl, and eubdummy.

